{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_52583","headline":"偈 · 法达","name":"偈","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"经诵三千部，曹溪一句亡。\n未明出世旨，宁歇累生狂。\n羊鹿牛权设，初中後善扬。\n谁知火宅内，元是法中王。\n（见《景德传灯录》卷五、《六祖大师法宝坛经》）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"法达","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_52583.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_52583","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}